An unpriced replacement cannot change the total SEK acquisition basis.

========== API ==========

aggregate()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity OLD
  format 1,000 OLD
commodity NEW
  format 1,000 NEW
account Assets:Shares
account Assets:Cash

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Shares  1 OLD {99 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -99 SEK

2024-02-01 Unpriced replacement
  Assets:Shares  2 NEW {{100 SEK}}
  Assets:Shares  -1 OLD {{99 SEK}}

========== WARNINGS ==========

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] An unpriced commodity replacement changes acquisition basis from 99 SEK to 100 SEK
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:15:1
